<view class="page page--with-action followup-profile">
  <view class="page-header"><view class="page-kicker">后续参与 · 基本资料</view><view class="page-title">只留下这次联系所需要的信息</view><view class="page-desc">这些信息不会改变你的关系说明书，也不会自动公开给其他用户。你可以随时修改或删除。</view></view>
  <view class="followup-form">
    <view class="dl-input-wrap"><view class="dl-input-label">称呼</view><input class="dl-input" maxlength="40" value="{{form.displayName}}" data-field="displayName" bindinput="input" /></view>
    <view class="dl-input-wrap"><view class="dl-input-label">城市或区域</view><input class="dl-input" maxlength="80" value="{{form.cityArea}}" data-field="cityArea" bindinput="input" /></view>
    <view class="dl-input-wrap"><view class="dl-input-label">合适的联系时间</view><input class="dl-input" maxlength="80" value="{{contact.preferredTime}}" data-field="preferredTime" bindinput="inputContact" /></view>
    <view class="section-title section-title--first">你愿意了解哪些参与方式</view>
    <view class="type-list"><button wx:for="{{participationTypes}}" wx:key="value" class="choice-option {{item.selected ? 'choice-option--selected' : ''}}" data-value="{{item.value}}" bindtap="toggleType"><view>{{item.label}}</view><view class="choice-option__check">{{item.selected ? '✓' : ''}}</view></button></view>
    <view class="section-title">联系方式</view>
    <view class="dl-input-wrap"><view class="dl-input-label">联系渠道（例如微信号、邮箱或电话）</view><input class="dl-input" maxlength="160" value="{{contact.value}}" data-field="value" bindinput="inputContact" /></view>
    <view class="dl-input-wrap"><view class="dl-input-label">渠道类型</view><input class="dl-input" maxlength="32" value="{{contact.channel}}" data-field="channel" bindinput="inputContact" /></view>
    <view class="dl-input-wrap"><view class="dl-input-label">补充说明（可选）</view><textarea class="dl-input dl-textarea" maxlength="500" value="{{form.note}}" data-field="note" bindinput="input" /></view>
    <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="field-error">{{error}}</view>
  </view>
  <view class="action-bar"><button class="dl-button" loading="{{isSaving}}" bindtap="save">保存并管理授权</button><button class="dl-button dl-button--ghost" bindtap="back">返回</button></view>
</view>
